{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seablip is an ambitious pirate RPG, created by solo developer Jardar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/9412a78185f608aad02b5f2927305aaf.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seablip features an open world map containing many islands to explore, enemies to fight, and treasures to find. Plunder and sink enemy vessels on your path to become a feared pirate, and discover hidden secrets waiting to be discovered as you sail the sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/00bfd8309f7a3a03875f6902d532529a.poster.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/00bfd8309f7a3a03875f6902d532529a.webm?t=1765873736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/00bfd8309f7a3a03875f6902d532529a.mp4?t=1765873736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Ship</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing the size and quality of your ship is a crucial part of the game, by buying a better one or by upgrading your existing one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 48 upgrades (cannons and other special upgrades) for your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of the upgrades offer unique attack/defense specialties: hull breach, fire, poison gas, magic shield, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combining certain effects such as water and electricity to give you the edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new combinations to maximize your offensive and defensive options, and help you survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire Sailors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sailor in Seablip is unique and there is a limited number, so treat them well! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sailors level up they will earn points to spend on attributes such as Health, Luck, and intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they progress, sailors can learn two random skills that can be used to aid them in each battle encounter. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different battle bonuses are given depending on the faction the sailor belongs to. Pirates, Redcoats, and Bluecoats are some of the factions you\u2019ll come across throughout the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/2043bfc8b7ca15e2d1c14a53981456da.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounty Hunter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the scourge of the seas as you face off against seven bosses in Seablip (more coming soon), each possessing a unique tactic and ship.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are free to roam as you please, defeating all the bosses is the main objective in the current Early Access version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/f32922a4699f1eddf98d8e8d6ff3f6cd.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and reel in your catch in a robust fishing minigame, as you take a break from conquering the sea. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden secrets and treasure, and generally get up to no good as you use your excellent lockpicking skills to great effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other smaller minigames are in development, and will be worked on and improved with the help of the community!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/ed4c9631cc1cb019e0a65fcc2097f16b347c7b3c.jpg"},{"name":"New Ship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/7ab307147f83a229821bf81096ebcf7c078b42bd.jpg"},{"name":"Friend of Whalgrim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/1a8564c85dc0a6beefbc789b48cb927fc2c45157.jpg"},{"name":"Friend of Pigs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/b04feafb89ddde8eb0c79f425746c239df829d16.jpg"},{"name":"Sunken Secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/911f69ce7a70d6b66d3f0f4da4b42e86f35d98d0.jpg"},{"name":"Master Locksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/8e16b1f96faef2d4f4facbcf068b83f110c4fbd7.jpg"},{"name":"Landlubber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/98669e069a85a56d8c3dc66055e8ad4a2f6bfb66.jpg"},{"name":"Whalgrim's Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/57d6ffdb677a620283485c062d31eddd81c254ba.jpg"},{"name":"Made Peace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/63c2fa2dcd2ee61ac9090e23e146ea3a866d1b67.jpg"},{"name":"Hide Behind the Mast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1471270/32bd4c2d8e2c55a0ee4097905dec3610905e87bf.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1471270?t=1765873736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765873736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/d2bd600e8277f74545c84d28ad2295dd44f65631/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765873736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/d2bd600e8277f74545c84d28ad2295dd44f65631/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765873736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seablip is an ambitious pirate RPG, created by solo developer Jardar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/9412a78185f608aad02b5f2927305aaf.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seablip features an open world map containing many islands to explore, enemies to fight, and treasures to find. Plunder and sink enemy vessels on your path to become a feared pirate, and discover hidden secrets waiting to be discovered as you sail the sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/00bfd8309f7a3a03875f6902d532529a.poster.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/00bfd8309f7a3a03875f6902d532529a.webm?t=1765873736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/00bfd8309f7a3a03875f6902d532529a.mp4?t=1765873736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Ship</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing the size and quality of your ship is a crucial part of the game, by buying a better one or by upgrading your existing one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 48 upgrades (cannons and other special upgrades) for your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of the upgrades offer unique attack/defense specialties: hull breach, fire, poison gas, magic shield, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combining certain effects such as water and electricity to give you the edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new combinations to maximize your offensive and defensive options, and help you survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire Sailors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sailor in Seablip is unique and there is a limited number, so treat them well! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sailors level up they will earn points to spend on attributes such as Health, Luck, and intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they progress, sailors can learn two random skills that can be used to aid them in each battle encounter. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different battle bonuses are given depending on the faction the sailor belongs to. Pirates, Redcoats, and Bluecoats are some of the factions you\u2019ll come across throughout the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/2043bfc8b7ca15e2d1c14a53981456da.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounty Hunter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the scourge of the seas as you face off against seven bosses in Seablip (more coming soon), each possessing a unique tactic and ship.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are free to roam as you please, defeating all the bosses is the main objective in the current Early Access version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/extras/f32922a4699f1eddf98d8e8d6ff3f6cd.avif?t=1765873736\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and reel in your catch in a robust fishing minigame, as you take a break from conquering the sea. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden secrets and treasure, and generally get up to no good as you use your excellent lockpicking skills to great effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other smaller minigames are in development, and will be worked on and improved with the help of the community!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Jardar Solli"],"dlc":[2829810],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471270/b92a9a4c7bab08eebdaca3c5df541beda05b3892/header.jpg?t=1765873736","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Vibedy AS","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB Dedicated Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Seablip is under development and the minimum requirements might change before a full release.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Seablip is under development and the minimum requirements might change before a full release.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1471270/1396326077/5b509f4a50f4a6cfb8398a7dc34ae538b199239b/1765541402/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765545357","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1471270/1396326077/5b509f4a50f4a6cfb8398a7dc34ae538b199239b/1765541402/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765545357","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1471270/1396326077/5b509f4a50f4a6cfb8398a7dc34ae538b199239b/1765541402/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765545357","id":257248507,"name":"Castle Update Available Now!!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257248507/12faa4a47174db7fbd6316626ad8ed73dd3f3840/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765545357"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1471270/779910/94c1de590198a16bad85259703e01b3ef3000929/1750692833/dash_av1.mpd?t=1730388450","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1471270/779910/94c1de590198a16bad85259703e01b3ef3000929/1750692833/dash_h264.mpd?t=1730388450","highlight":true,"